  "note": [
    "Year 2022 the method was slightly modified. If the respondent had given wooden stove use, but no wood fuel use, the wood use was set to 1-5m3, earlier years the amount had been set to <1m3. \r\n That lead to that some buildings that earlier had been categorised 'Only electrical heat' 2022 was categorised as 'Biofuel and electricity', (since wood use more than 1 m3 is counted as bio fuel)."
